WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:04.004
(sighs)

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.089
Lucy, are we boring?

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.758
No, I'm not,
you might be.

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:09.468
-You know what we need to do?
-Hm?

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:11.970
Let's get outta here and
let's go on a group vacation.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.389
-Yes!
-Get crazy, spice things up.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.641
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:18.310
#

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.521
We could rent, like,
one of those big, fancy houses.

00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:22.105
Remember the last time
we did that in Santa Barbara

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.732
and Todd cheaped out
on everything?

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:25.442
Oh no.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.069
How is he even an adult?

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:29.196
So it's only $250 each.

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:31.281
Yeah, it's not bad, right?

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:34.159
Uh...I'll give you $75,

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:36.453
and then I'm gonna take
a little bottle of wine.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.247
Are you haggling with me?
What are you doing?

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:39.706
What? It's free, isn't it?

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.500
We grabbed some groceries
from the store,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.960
so you can just throw us cash
whenever.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.546
No thanks, got my own.

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:47.547
You're gonna eat bacon
the whole trip?

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.132
Todd, we're going wine tasting,

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:51.009
you should probably
put some pants on.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.219
How much does it cost?

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.428
Why are we friends
with him?

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.596
'Cause we love him.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:57.307
Sweet meets savory.
Mmm!

00:00:57.307 --> 00:01:00.143
And all of his
disgusting habits.

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:01.561
Ooh, what about skiing?

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.188
Remember the last time
we went up north?

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.607
-Milo and his baby bladder.
-He's like a Chihuahua.

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:07.818
Oh, you know what though?
Vegas isn't that far.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:09.569
Except I'd have
to lecture Ben.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.113
What, has he been gambling
or something?

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:13.156
Oh no-no-no,
it's a packing thing.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:15.200
-What do you mean?
-Every time we stay in a hotel,

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.910
he brings our entire house.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.328
-Oh.
-Hey, what's goin' on?

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:20.038
We're going to Vegas
for a night.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.666
You know that most hotels
provide bedding, right?

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:25.002
-Yeah, it's Vegas though.
-Yeah.

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:27.546
Oh, but good call on the
skateboard and the teddy bear.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.339
Could you grab this
so I can get my arm out?

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.340
Yup.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.217
Is this my college backpack?

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:34.011
That is...insane.

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:36.805
I love my husband, but maybe
it should just be you and me.

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:38.557
As long as we can have
separate rooms, which...

00:01:38.557 --> 00:01:40.058
-What?!
-...we'll make sure happens

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.184
because this.

00:01:41.184 --> 00:01:43.020
Man, that's a medical condition.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.688
#

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:45.856
(screaming)

00:01:45.856 --> 00:01:49.776
(all screaming)

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:52.613
She sees dead people,
doesn't she?

00:01:52.613 --> 00:01:54.072
I knew it.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:56.283
Calm down,
she's having a night terror.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:58.910
(yawns)

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.454
(screaming)

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:03.623
Do you remember this?
You sound like a monkey

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.334
being murdered in the woods.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.127
Well, how 'bout the time

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.755
we put you in charge
of the room reservation

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:11.173
the last time we went to Vegas?

00:02:11.173 --> 00:02:13.759
I remember a fun night.

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:15.969
I'm very over it!

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:19.598
Hey guys!
Can we go to the hotel now?

00:02:19.598 --> 00:02:21.808
Um...you guys,
the funny thing is

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.810
is that I booked the hotel
for the wrong night.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.395
We can't get it
'til tomorrow.

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:26.855
You know what?
Things don't close in Vegas.

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:28.023
You know what they say?

00:02:28.023 --> 00:02:30.442
Motel, mo' problems!

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:31.651
-No.
-They don't say that!

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.070
It's not that big of a deal.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:35.030
Maybe we should just stay here
and cook.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.823
(laughing)

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.826
Oh, don't turn that oven on,
there's shoes in there.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:40.869
You keep your shoes
in your stove?

00:02:40.869 --> 00:02:41.912
We gotta make closets, you know?

00:02:41.912 --> 00:02:43.163
Look how tiny this thing is.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.539
We could make, um,

00:02:44.539 --> 00:02:45.916
shoestring French fries.

00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:47.918
Nope. No. Stop it.

00:02:47.918 --> 00:02:49.378
-I got more.
-I can't handle it.

00:02:49.378 --> 00:02:51.672
These shoes are made
for baking.

00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:53.799
No. What is wrong with you
today?

